- **Super Admin**: Platform owners (all permissions, system configuration)

### Custom Roles

To define project-specific roles:

- **Project Owner**: Creator of project
- **Collaborator**: Invited contributor
- **Viewer**: Read-only access to private project
- **Manager**: Special permissions for project management
- **Publisher**: Can publish projects publicly

